<ul>
<li><strong>Welcome to PUSHTYPE 10.</strong> Enter your license key in Settings ▸ License, or when setup asks for it.  One license covers up to three Macs.</li>
<li><strong>Works offline.</strong> PUSHTYPE checks your license when you're online, and keeps working for 30 days without the internet.</li>
